{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 38,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        68.93421936035156,
        162.8167266845703,
        85.31422424316406
      ],
      "text": "Patient equity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        95.56519317626953,
        527.3480834960938,
        108.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "The limited availability of Xpert Ultra in health facilities and the high costs incurred by patients",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.996999740600586,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        111.06519317626953,
        439.61297607421875,
        124.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "and health facilities for its use were reported as concerns in terms of equity.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        136.57679748535156,
        156.2059326171875,
        152.95680236816406
      ],
      "text": "Acceptability",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        163.20782470703125,
        527.1243286132812,
        176.3528289794922
      ],
      "text": "There were challenges to using Xpert MTB/RIF in the health care system. These challenges",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        178.70782470703125,
        526.9701538085938,
        191.8528289794922
      ],
      "text": "included underuse of the test and delays in the diagnostic pathway because of poor sample",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.20782470703125,
        527.1824340820312,
        207.3528289794922
      ],
      "text": "quality, insufficient resources and maintenance of the testing platforms, lack of functional",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        209.70782470703125,
        526.9515380859375,
        222.8528289794922
      ],
      "text": "data connectivity systems or record systems, inefficient patient flows, unavailability of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        225.20782470703125,
        526.98095703125,
        238.3528289794922
      ],
      "text": "updated clinical guidelines, and poor ownership of and accountability for the tests by health",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        240.70782470703125,
        526.9149169921875,
        253.8528289794922
      ],
      "text": "facilities. Overreliance on test results, rather than clinical judgement, and a lack of data-driven",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        256.20782470703125,
        275.6172790527344,
        269.35284423828125
      ],
      "text": "implementation processes were reported.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        280.21173095703125,
        527.0029907226562,
        293.35675048828125
      ],
      "text": "Access to the test may be limited owing to lack of sustainable funding, restrictions by donors,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.71173095703125,
        526.7997436523438,
        308.85675048828125
      ],
      "text": "poor referral systems, dependence on outreach workers, unavailability of community TB",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.21173095703125,
        341.1535949707031,
        324.35675048828125
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic facilities and too many eligibility restrictions.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        336.7232360839844,
        136.2740936279297,
        353.10321044921875
      ],
      "text": "Feasibility",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        363.3542175292969,
        526.9478149414062,
        376.4992370605469
      ],
      "text": "As with Xpert MTB/RIF, implementation of Xpert Ultra could be hindered by infrastructural",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        378.8542175292969,
        526.9426879882812,
        391.9992370605469
      ],
      "text": "problems, such as power outages, staff shortages, limited availability of transportation for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        394.3542175292969,
        483.9754638671875,
        407.4992370605469
      ],
      "text": "sputum samples and limited availability of Xpert testing platforms in health facilities.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        419.8658142089844,
        275.1541442871094,
        436.24578857421875
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        446.4967041015625,
        78.81909942626953,
        459.6417236328125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        446.4967041015625,
        526.9644165039062,
        459.6417236328125
      ],
      "text": "Diagnostic products in the low-complexity classes of tests should be prequalified by WHO",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        461.9967041015625,
        342.7539978027344,
        475.1417236328125
      ],
      "text": "or approved by another regulator before clinical use.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        477.4967041015625,
        78.81909942626953,
        490.6417236328125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        477.4967041015625,
        527.0965576171875,
        490.6417236328125
      ],
      "text": "Diagnostic test manufacturers, laboratory and programme managers, and policy-makers",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        492.9967041015625,
        354.4422302246094,
        506.1417236328125
      ],
      "text": "should be educated on the WHO PQ process for TB IVDs (",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.950187683105469,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        354.2065124511719,
        492.9967041015625,
        518.63134765625,
        506.1417236328125
      ],
      "text": "https://extranet.who.int/prequal/",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.950187683105469,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.4398193359375,
        492.9967041015625,
        524.413330078125,
        506.1417236328125
      ],
      "text": ").",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.950187683105469,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        508.4967041015625,
        78.81909942626953,
        521.6417236328125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        508.4967041015625,
        512.767578125,
        521.6417236328125
      ],
      "text": "Ensuring sufficient volume and specimen quality is important to obtain accurate results.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        523.9967041015625,
        78.81909942626953,
        537.1417236328125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        523.9967041015625,
        526.9093627929688,
        537.1417236328125
      ],
      "text": "Safe waste disposal of used test consumables needs to be planned in advance to minimize",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        539.4967041015625,
        178.802001953125,
        552.6417236328125
      ],
      "text": "environmental risk.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        554.9967041015625,
        78.81909942626953,
        568.1417236328125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        554.9967041015625,
        527.0338134765625,
        568.1417236328125
      ],
      "text": "Trace positive results on respiratory samples may present false-positive results for TB disease",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.975772857666016,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        570.4967041015625,
        526.9849243164062,
        583.6417236328125
      ],
      "text": "(  non-viable but DNA detected) in those that are HIV negative or not at risk for HIV,  M. tb.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        585.9967041015625,
        491.5267028808594,
        599.1417236328125
      ],
      "text": "and those with a prior history of TB and an end of treatment within the last 5 years.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        601.4967041015625,
        78.81909942626953,
        614.6417236328125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        601.4967041015625,
        526.9971313476562,
        614.6417236328125
      ],
      "text": "For tests that do not have integrated rifampicin-resistance detection as an all-in-one test,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        616.9967041015625,
        526.640625,
        630.1417236328125
      ],
      "text": "reflex testing for resistance should be performed at the same time for all TB-positive patients",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.963489532470703,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        632.4967041015625,
        526.8983764648438,
        645.6417236328125
      ],
      "text": "to support universal access to DST for rifampicin, at a minimum, and to reduce the risk of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        647.9967041015625,
        169.2003936767578,
        661.1417236328125
      ],
      "text": "loss to follow-up.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        385.0820007324219,
        663.477294921875,
        388.7630615234375,
        671.1408081054688
      ],
      "text": "7",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 6.413000106811523,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        663.4967041015625,
        78.81909942626953,
        676.6417236328125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        663.4967041015625,
        526.96484375,
        676.6417236328125
      ],
      "text": "In settings with a very low prevalence of rifampicin resistance , i.e. less than 2%, a positive",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        678.9967041015625,
        526.6522216796875,
        692.1417236328125
      ],
      "text": "test result for rifampicin resistance may represent a false positive result, and indicate a need",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.986942291259766,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        694.4967041015625,
        472.3760681152344,
        707.6417236328125
      ],
      "text": "for further testing with an alternative method or, at a minimum, repeat testing.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        741.3698120117188,
        526.3057250976562,
        750.9439086914062
      ],
      "text": "7\t The 2% prevalence was used as the lowest one in evidence synthesis and analysis to inform GDG meeting. At this prevalence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        752.3839111328125,
        524.3860473632812,
        761.9439086914062
      ],
      "text": "level the number of false-positive results amounted to 19 out of 1000 eligible patients tested and equalized number of true-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        763.3839111328125,
        138.298095703125,
        772.9439086914062
      ],
      "text": "positive results.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "22 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}